<title>PORTUGAL: Lisnave shares resume trade - dealers.</title>
<headline>Lisnave shares resume trade - dealers.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portugal's Securities Market Commission lifted a suspension in trade of shares of ship repairer Lisnave after the announcement of a restructuring deal between the company and the government, dealers said.</p>
</text>
